  "prefLabel": "Gcd 211.11 Decision on Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 211.11 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. Within 10 days of its receipt of a motion for rehearing, the commission shall notify all parties and intervenors that it has:\n\n(a) Granted or denied the motion for rehearing; or\n\n(b) Suspended its final decision pending further consideration of the motion.\n\nSource. #7635-A, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10339, eff 5-17-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gcd100-400.html"
